  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: c9876f83510731f4d97169c0d46b0606, type: 3}
  m_Name: Lucifer Greetings - DialogueLine 18
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  lines:
  - participant: 0
    englishLine: ' Ok, and why the name Mr. Crowley?'
    portugueseLine: Ta e porque o nome Mr Crowley
    chineseLine: "\u597D\uFF0C\u90A3\u4E3A\u5565\u53EB\u514B\u52B3\u5229\u5148\u751F?  "
    spanishLine: " Ok, \xBFy por qu\xE9 el nombre Mr. Crowley?"
  - participant: 1
    englishLine: " It\u2019s from a song I like."
    portugueseLine: "\xC9 de uma m\xFAsica que eu gosto. "
    chineseLine: "\u6211\u559C\u6B22\u7684\u4E00\u9996\u6B4C\u91CC\u6709\u8FD9\u4E2A\u540D\u5B57\u3002"
    spanishLine: " Es de una canci\xF3n que me gusta."
  - participant: 0
    englishLine: " If someone had told me the Baddie is so nice, I would\u2019ve
      talked to you sooner."
    portugueseLine: "Se tivessem me falado que o Coisa Ruim \xE9 t\xE3o gente boa,
      eu teria falado antes com voc\xEA. "
    chineseLine: "\u8981\u662F\u6709\u4EBA\u65E9\u544A\u8BC9\u6211\u8FD9\u201C\u574F\u4E1C\u897F\u201D\u633A\u597D\u76F8\u5904\uFF0C\u6211\u65E9\u5C31\u627E\u4F60\u4E86\u3002"
    spanishLine: " Si alguien me hubiera dicho que el Malo es tan buena onda, habr\xEDa
      hablado contigo antes."
